[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10863.11, "timestamp": "03:01:03", "text": "想看她吗？我看见你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10865.83, "timestamp": "03:01:05", "text": "你看？好了，我们结束吧。是的，我看到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10869.03, "timestamp": "03:01:09", "text": "你。你想……哦，好的。你其实"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10872.55, "timestamp": "03:01:12", "text": "想得到一些好的，我们来弄一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10878.79, "timestamp": "03:01:18", "text": "但这不过是四颗钻石而已。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10882.63, "timestamp": "03:01:22", "text": "需要很多钻石才能获得齿轮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10885.429, "timestamp": "03:01:25", "text": "得到什么？你需要很多“他们是”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10888.23, "timestamp": "03:01:28", "text": "不过，钻石块倒是挺不错的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10892.07, "timestamp": "03:01:32", "text": "它们每个人都给出了 n。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10894.55, "timestamp": "03:01:34", "text": "真的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10903.03, "timestamp": "03:01:43", "text": "你在上面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10906.07, "timestamp": "03:01:46", "text": "那是《财富》第三张图吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10910.23, "timestamp": "03:01:50", "text": "等等，哦，好的。你可以拿一些。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10918.07, "timestamp": "03:01:58", "text": "好的，我会给你的。"}]